      "before": "## S10. Execution principal `repository-code`",
      "after": "## S10. Execution principal `repository-code`\n\n**R3-MR1 prospective owner file-manifest membership and raw recipes.** The exact CONTRACT.md, recipe-table.json, owner-file-manifest-recipes.schema.json and materialization-map.json under docs/implementation/m3/snapshot-plan-c/r3-mr1-r1/ select complete retained sealed snapshot sourceInventory for admitted snapshot owners and one complete admitted dependency package file manifest for dependency owners. ownerFileManifestSha256 is raw SHA256 of the exact source-selected canonical array, preserving snapshot Blob fields and dependency manifest fields without row expansion/filter/wrapper. Source admission remains indispensable; equal files do not transfer owner/source authority. Existing canonical/order/shape/custody/bounds and native domain/security owner-row digest distinctions remain. Snapshot recipe adds no descriptor capacity restriction. One future security-owned library function is also used by the harness. This narrow membership/recipe selection does not resolve complete R3: exact package/owner witness codecs, producer/provenance/failure publication and actual owning library/product controls remain required before C3c. Historical records and recipe/schema selections are not rewritten.\n"
    },
    {
      "parent": {
        "path": "docs/v2/contracts/product-v1/native-evidence.md",
        "bytes": 329013,
        "sha256": "83b99783893bec4bcca76bc043310e1d33305fc41ef85e012fbcb19e5b222ca0"
      },
      "selector": {
        "line": 1803
      },
      "before": "### 3.6 `PreparedOutputSetV3`: inert rows only (feedback 4, R2)",
      "after": "### 3.6 `PreparedOutputSetV3`: inert rows only (feedback 4, R2)\n\n**R3-MR1 prospective prepared owner-file-manifest recipes.** docs/implementation/m3/snapshot-plan-c/r3-mr1-r1/CONTRACT.md and exact source-specific schema/recipe table select the security-owned raw owner digest preimage for new-M3 prepared inputBinding. Complete retained snapshot Blob array or admitted dependency package manifest array is chosen only by actual admitted source witness. No ambient path, caller subset, source default, raw-vs-domain digest substitution or extra snapshot capacity restriction. PO1 stale checks, dependencySourceSetId/toolchain/cfg and inert owner/site/generated joins remain unchanged. Complete R3/package-owner codec/failure publication and actual product controls remain open; this selection alone does not admit prepared owners or enable C3c.\n"
    }
  ],
